ion removes metabolic waste products that could harm the body if they accumulated.","learning_outcomes":["Match common waste products to excretory organs and explain why waste removal matters."],"study_sections":[{"content":"Excretion removes metabolic waste products that could harm the body if they accumulated.","heading":"Core idea"},{"content":"Match common waste products to excretory organs and explain why waste removal matters.","heading":"Study focus"},{"content":"Why must metabolic waste be removed from the body?","heading":"Check your understanding"}],"source_pages":[31],"source_url":"https://ncdc.go.ug/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/NCDC_AEP_BIOLOGY_LSC_level-1and-2_-Final-2024-Web-file_Final-08.03.2024.pdf"},{"source_document_id":"ncdc-aep-biology-lsc-level-1-2-2023","level_label":"Level 2","title":"Food Chains and Food Webs","summary":"Food chains show a feeding pathway and food webs connect several pathways, revealing how organisms depend on one another.","learning_outcomes":["Identify producers and consumers and draw feeding relationships using arrows."],"study_sections":[{"content":"Food chains show a feeding pathway and food webs connect several pathways, revealing how organisms depend on one another.","heading":"Core idea"},{"content":"Identify producers and consumers and draw feeding relationships using arrows.","heading":"Study focus"},{"content":"What does an arrow in a food chain represent?","heading":"Check your understanding"}],"source_pages":[52],"source_url":"https://ncdc.go.ug/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/NCDC_AEP_BIOLOGY_LSC_level-1and-2_-Final-2024-Web-file_Final-08.03.2024.pdf"},{"source_document_id":"ncdc-aep-biology-lsc-level-1-2-2023","level_label":"Level 2","title":"Gaseous Exchange","summary":"Organisms exchange gases with their surroundings through surfaces adapted to the needs of each organism.","learning_outcomes":["Compare gas-exchange surfaces and relate their structures to their functions."],"study_sections":[{"content":"Organisms ex